# Shortcuts

## How to trigger contextual action, suggestions / auto completion.

# Context

## Customer message

Writing experience is in heart of Peek. Shortcuts are power tools that help you focus on writing itself and same time manage lots of things by just writing + auto-completion.

## Problem

During writing, often you need or want to manage things that are related to the thing you're writing about. That can be distracting as you might abandon your "flow" and start searching for things. That's why we want to have powerful way how through shortcuts you can manage many things directly from the writing text field.

# Solution

Here are common universal shortcuts with examples how to use them.

